 ### [Wavefront Path Tracer with Spatial Hashing](4490-wavefront-path-tracer-with-spatial-hashing.md)
-A path tracing method that uses spatial hashing to accumulate radiance estimates before final display. It differs from standard path tracing by decoupling the accumulation buffer from the pixel grid, enabling spatial averaging of radiance estimates across hash buckets. Choose this variant when rendering scenes where spatial coherence across pixels can be exploited to reduce variance before compositing.
